               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "the ScriptsLib/BuildClang.sh now works and has been tested with 3.0.1.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "This script builds the libc++ library.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "I was able to test - but the test failed. I opened a new bug to track / debug that failure.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "At least we can build our own copy of clang now...",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
